      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated doctors amid service critiques"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many long-term clients commend veterinarians like Dr. Buchanan, Dr. Moon, and Dr. Fuller for their thorough bedside manner and genuine empathy. In contrast, several critical reviews describe negative encounters with support staff, citing instances of unreturned phone calls, abrupt handling by technicians, and refusal to dispense medical supplies to non-registered pets."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Feline accommodations alongside handling concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Cat owners enthusiastically praise the dedicated feline clinic area and fear-free techniques that significantly reduce stress during visits. However, some dog owners express reservations, recounting stressful blood draws where pets yelped, or noting perceptions that certain staff members appeared uncomfortable when handling larger, energetic canine patients."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Widespread dissatisfaction with clinic fees"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients express significant frustration regarding high veterinary costs, noting that fees have escalated steeply following corporate acquisition. Multiple reviewers criticize compulsory consultation charges, unexpected diagnostic add-ons, and expensive prescription medication. While a few pet owners found billing transparent, complaints regarding pricing persist."
      }
    }
  ],
